running function's first argument and its __class__ cell."] [788 2 "// supercheck: a proxy's __class__ (a class it pretends to be an instance of)"] [815 2 "// method_reduce (classobject.c): getattr(self, the function's name)"] [830 2 "// functions as descriptors, bound methods"] [837 2 "// types.MethodType(func, instance) (method_new)"] [863 2 "// method_descr_get: a bound method is not bound again (gh-113157)"] [902 2 "// slot wrappers"] [939 2 "// method-wrapper (descrobject.c's wrapper_call, wrapper_repr, wrapper_richcompare, wrapper_hash, wrapper_members,"] [940 2 "// wrapper_getsets, wrapper_reduce; queue 290): a slot wrapper bound to its instance, no __func__ and no"] [941 2 "// delegation to the wrapper's attributes; not bound again as an attribute of a class (no tp_descr_get)"] [981 2 "// classmethod_descriptor (descrobject.c's classmethod_get, classmethoddescr_call, method_repr, descr_reduce; queue"] [982 2 "// 290): bound to the class it is asked through (a builtin_function_or_method whose __self__ is the class), called"] [983 2 "// with the class first"] [1048 2 "// classmethod, staticmethod (funcobject.c): a subclass's instance is an Instance around the Go value, so every"] [1049 2 "// slot unwraps; __init__ copies the wrapped callable's attributes (functools_wraps) into the dict"] [1075 19 "// a classmethod made by a program, not a built-in type's descriptor"] [1101 3 "// a built-in type's classmethod_descriptor: a builtin_function_or_method bound to the class (dict.fromkeys)"] [1159 3 "// descriptor_get_wrapped_attribute and its setter: the dict first, the callable's value kept there"] [1204 2 "// property"] [1336 2 "// __slots__' members"] [1417 2 "// super"] [1464 5 "// a built-in type's method, or a method descriptor in a heap type's dict (methodDescrs: _ast's AST,"] [1465 5 "// queue 202c: super().__init__ in a node class's subclass)"] [1493 53 "// a subclass of super: its type called"] [1515 2 "// mappingproxy"] [1517 2 "// mappingproxy(mapping), 